Third-party components

RoomBeam contains no third-party source code. Its two runtime dependencies are
installed from npm and are not redistributed as part of this repository:

  ws          MIT
  selfsigned  MIT

Both permit private and commercial use without restriction. Their licences
require that their copyright notices accompany the software only if it is
distributed — so if this project is ever shipped as a bundle, installer, or
container image, those notices must travel with it.
